ecords.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            In visiting our site, if you give us personal data in order to\n                            receive any type of information in return from us, we collect and\n                            store that data. That information is helpful to better design our\n                            site because we know the frequency of visits to the individual pages\n                            within our site.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            In visiting our site, if you view specific pages or download\n                            information from specific pages, we track visits to those pages in\n                            order to measure the number of visitors to our website. That\n                            information is helpful to better design our site because we know\n                            which pages within our site are frequented. However, we do not\n                            automatically collect your personal e-mail address simply because you\n                            visit our site. All we know, based on the information that we\n                            collect, is the number of times on a date that a particular page was\n                            visited.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            We may share aggregate demographic information with our partners.\n                            This is not linked to any personal information that can identify you\n                            or any other visitor to our website. If we partner in the future\n                            with a third party to provide services, when you sign up for these\n                            services we will share names and other contact information that is\n                            necessary for our partner to provide these services. These parties\n                            are not allowed to use your personally identifiable information\n                            except for the purpose of providing these services.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            When you visit www.nyatigroup.com or voluntarily send e-mails to us,\n                            you are communicating with us electronically. We will keep a record\n                            of this information so that we can respond to you periodically. We\n                            only collect information from you when you register on our website\n                            or fill out a form. Also, when filling out a form on our website,\n                            you may be asked to enter your: Name, E-mail address or Phone /\n                            Mobile Number. You may, however, visit our website anonymously.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            By communicating with us and submitting your personal information\n                            and contact details, you consent to receive communication from us\n                            through Email, SMS, Call, WhatsApp or any other communication\n                            medium, even if your number has DND activated on it. You agree that\n                            all agreements, notices, disclosures, and other communications that\n                            we provide to you electronically satisfy any legal requirement that\n                            such communication be in writing.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n                    "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"52:T425,\n                        \u003ch2\u003eDisclaimer\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            The information on this site is provided “as is” without any\n                            warranties, express or implied, including but not limited to the\n                            implied warranties for a particular purpose, or non-infringement.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Nyati Construction Pvt. Ltd. makes no representation or warranty\n                            that the information contained on this site will be timely or\n                            error-free. Nyati Construction Pvt. Ltd. have not reviewed all the\n                            sites that may be linked to its sites and does not endorse and is\n                            not responsible for the content of any off-site pages or any other\n                            sites linked to these sites. Your linking to such sites is at your\n                            own risk.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n                    53:T1dba,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\n                        \u003ch2\u003eIntroduction\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            At Nyati Group, your privacy is of utmost importance to us. We are committed\n                            to ensuring that your personal information remains confidential, secure, and\n                            is used only in ways that are consistent with your expectations. This policy\n                            outlines how we collect, use, store, and protect the information you share\n                            with us via our website:\n                            \u003ca href=\"https://www.nyatigroup.com\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\n                                www.nyatigroup.com\n                            \u003c/a\u003e.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eInformation We Collect\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            To provide you with detailed information about our residential and commercial\n                            projects, we may ask you to share your name, contact number, email address,\n                            and other basic information. This allows us to offer you timely updates,\n                            personalized support, and project-specific details.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            From time to time, we may request additional information to better understand\n                            your preferences and serve you more efficiently. We may also collect usage\n                            data through tools such as cookies and session variables, which help us\n                            enhance the browsing experience and analyze site traffic. These cookies do\n                            not capture personal information unless you voluntarily provide it.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Additionally, we may retain records of your communication with us - including\n                            emails, queries, survey responses, and feedback - to ensure continuous\n                            improvement in our customer service.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eUse of Collected Information\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            The information collected is used solely to improve your experience with\n                            Nyati Group, including:\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cul\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eResponding to enquiries and service requests\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eSending updates, newsletters, or promotional content\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eProviding project-related information and offers\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eEnhancing website functionality and user experience\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003c/ul\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            We do not sell or rent any personal information to third parties. However,\n                            we may share aggregated, non-personally identifiable insights with our\n                            marketing partners or affiliates to understand customer behaviour and\n                            preferences.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Your personal data will only be shared in the following circumstances:\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cul\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eWith your explicit consent\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\n                                When legally required to comply with government or judicial orders\n                            \u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\n                                To facilitate a service or transaction you have requested\n                            \u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\n                                During corporate restructuring or sale of the company, where successor\n                                entities may gain access under strict confidentiality\n                            \u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003c/ul\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eData Storage and Security\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Nyati Group employs industry-standard security measures to safeguard your\n                            information against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. Although we strive\n                            to keep our systems secure, no platform is completely immune to cyber\n                            threats. We will not be liable for any loss of data due to events beyond\n                            our reasonable control, such as cyberattacks or technical failures.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Data is stored only as long as it is necessary to fulfil its intended\n                            purpose, after which it may be securely deleted or anonymized.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eCommunication Preferences\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            You have full control over how you’d like to hear from us. You may opt out\n                            of receiving marketing communications, newsletters, or promotional content\n                            at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link in our emails or by updating\n                            your preferences on our website.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eDisclaimer and Limitation of Liability\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Nyati Group makes every effort to ensure the accuracy of information shared\n                            on our website. However, we do not guarantee that all content is free from\n                            errors or omissions. All project-related visuals, specifications, and\n                            timelines are subject to change without prior notice, and do not constitute\n                            a legal offering.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            We are not responsible for any direct or indirect loss that may arise from\n                            the reliance on the information provided on our website.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003ePolicy Updates\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Nyati Group reserves the right to update or revise this privacy policy from\n                            time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. Any\n                            modifications will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            For any concerns or queries regarding your privacy, please contact us at:\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            \u003cstrong\u003eEmail:\u003c/strong\u003e\n                            \u003ca href=\"mailto:info@nyatigroup.com\"\u003e\n                                info@nyatigroup.com\n                            \u003c/a\u003e\n                            \u003cbr /\u003e\n\n                            \u003cstrong\u003ePhone:\u003c/strong\u003e\n                            \u003ca href=\"tel:+912066863333\"\u003e\n                                +91 2066863333\n                            \u003c/a\u003e\n                            \u003cbr /\u003e\n\n                            \u003cstrong\u003eWebsite:\u003c/strong\u003e\n                            \u003ca href=\"https://www.nyatigroup.com\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\n                                www.nyatigroup.com\n                            \u003c/a\u003e\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n                    "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"54:T470,\n                        \u003ch2\u003eCancellation and Refund Policy\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            In case the Allottee / Purchaser/s cancels the booking of the Unit\n                            / Apartment and or in the event of cancellation/termination of the\n                            Agreement in respect of the Unit agreed to be purchased by the\n                            Allottee, the Promoter shall forfeit the amount paid by the\n                            Allottee /s in terms of the Allotment Letter and or the Agreement\n                            (as the case may be) and the balance amount due and payable if any,\n                            shall be refunded to the Allottee/ Purchaser in terms thereof.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eDispute Resolution\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Any disputes between the parties shall be settled amicably. In case\n                            of failure to settle such dispute amicably, the same shall be\n                            referred to RERA.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n                    55:T1050,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\n                        \u003ch2\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Thanks for visiting our website. Nyati Construction Pvt. Ltd.\n                            appreciates your interest in our organisation and the facilities we\n                            offer. Your privacy is important to us and we want you to feel\n                            comfortable in visiting our site. Any personal information that you\n                            may give us, including your e-mail address, is used only for data\n                            storing for our personal records.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            In visiting our site, if you give us personal data in order to\n                            receive any type of information in return from us, we collect and\n                            store that data. That information is helpful to better design our\n                            site because we know the frequency of visits to the individual pages\n                            within our site.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            In visiting our site, if you view specific pages or download\n                            information from specific pages, we track visits to those pages in\n                            order to measure the number of visitors to our website. That\n                            information is helpful to better design our site because we know\n                            which pages within our site are frequented. However, we do not\n                            automatically collect your personal e-mail address simply because you\n                            visit our site. All we know, based on the information that we\n                            collect, is the number of times on a date that a particular page was\n                            visited.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            We may share aggregate demographic information with our partners.\n                            This is not linked to any personal information that can identify you\n                            or any other visitor to our website. If we partner in the future\n                            with a third party to provide services, when you sign up for these\n                            services we will share names and other contact information that is\n                            necessary for our partner to provide these services. These parties\n                            are not allowed to use your personally identifiable information\n                            except for the purpose of providing these services.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            When you visit www.nyatigroup.com or voluntarily send e-mails to us,\n                            you are communicating with us electronically. We will keep a record\n                            of this information so that we can respond to you periodically. We\n                            only collect information from you when you register on our website\n                            or fill out a form. Also, when filling out a form on our website,\n                            you may be asked to enter your: Name, E-mail address or Phone /\n                            Mobile Number. You may, however, visit our website anonymously.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            By communicating with us and submitting your personal information\n                            and contact details, you consent to receive communication from us\n                            through Email, SMS, Call, WhatsApp or any other communication\n                            medium, even if your number has DND activated on it. You agree that\n                            all agreements, notices, disclosures, and other communications that\n                            we provide to you electronically satisfy any legal requirement that\n                            such communication be in writing.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n                    "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"56:T425,\n                        \u003ch2\u003eDisclaimer\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            The information on this site is provided “as is” without any\n                            warranties, express or implied, including but not limited to the\n                            implied warranties for a particular purpose, or non-infringement.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Nyati Construction Pvt. Ltd. makes no representation or warranty\n                            that the information contained on this site will be timely or\n                            error-free. Nyati Construction Pvt. Ltd. have not reviewed all the\n                            sites that may be linked to its sites and does not endorse and is\n                            not responsible for the content of any off-site pages or any other\n                            sites linked to these sites. Your linking to such sites is at your\n                            own risk.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n                    57:T1dba,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\n                        \u003ch2\u003eIntroduction\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            At Nyati Group, your privacy is of utmost importance to us. We are committed\n                            to ensuring that your personal information remains confidential, secure, and\n                            is used only in ways that are consistent with your expectations. This policy\n                            outlines how we collect, use, store, and protect the information you share\n                            with us via our website:\n                            \u003ca href=\"https://www.nyatigroup.com\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\n                                www.nyatigroup.com\n                            \u003c/a\u003e.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eInformation We Collect\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            To provide you with detailed information about our residential and commercial\n                            projects, we may ask you to share your name, contact number, email address,\n                            and other basic information. This allows us to offer you timely updates,\n                            personalized support, and project-specific details.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            From time to time, we may request additional information to better understand\n                            your preferences and serve you more efficiently. We may also collect usage\n                            data through tools such as cookies and session variables, which help us\n                            enhance the browsing experience and analyze site traffic. These cookies do\n                            not capture personal information unless you voluntarily provide it.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Additionally, we may retain records of your communication with us - including\n                            emails, queries, survey responses, and feedback - to ensure continuous\n                            improvement in our customer service.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eUse of Collected Information\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            The information collected is used solely to improve your experience with\n                            Nyati Group, including:\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cul\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eResponding to enquiries and service requests\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eSending updates, newsletters, or promotional content\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eProviding project-related information and offers\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eEnhancing website functionality and user experience\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003c/ul\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            We do not sell or rent any personal information to third parties. However,\n                            we may share aggregated, non-personally identifiable insights with our\n                            marketing partners or affiliates to understand customer behaviour and\n                            preferences.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Your personal data will only be shared in the following circumstances:\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cul\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eWith your explicit consent\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\n                                When legally required to comply with government or judicial orders\n                            \u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\n                                To facilitate a service or transaction you have requested\n                            \u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\n                                During corporate restructuring or sale of the company, where successor\n                                entities may gain access under strict confidentiality\n                            \u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003c/ul\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eData Storage and Security\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Nyati Group employs industry-standard security measures to safeguard your\n                            information against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. Although we strive\n                            to keep our systems secure, no platform is completely immune to cyber\n                            threats. We will not be liable for any loss of data due to events beyond\n                            our reasonable control, such as cyberattacks or technical failures.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Data is stored only as long as it is necessary to fulfil its intended\n                            purpose, after which it may be securely deleted or anonymized.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eCommunication Preferences\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            You have full control over how you’d like to hear from us. You may opt out\n                            of receiving marketing communications, newsletters, or promotional content\n                            at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link in our emails or by updating\n                            your preferences on our website.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eDisclaimer and Limitation of Liability\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Nyati Group makes every effort to ensure the accuracy of information shared\n                            on our website. However, we do not guarantee that all content is free from\n                            errors or omissions. All project-related visuals, specifications, and\n                            timelines are subject to change without prior notice, and do not constitute\n                            a legal offering.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            We are not responsible for any direct or indirect loss that may arise from\n                            the reliance on the information provided on our website.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003ePolicy Updates\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Nyati Group reserves the right to update or revise this privacy policy from\n                            time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. Any\n                            modifications will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            For any concerns or queries regarding your privacy, please contact us at:\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            \u003cstrong\u003eEmail:\u003c/strong\u003e\n                            \u003ca href=\"mailto:info@nyatigroup.com\"\u003e\n                                info@nyatigroup.com\n                            \u003c/a\u003e\n                            \u003cbr /\u003e\n\n                            \u003cstrong\u003ePhone:\u003c/strong\u003e\n                            \u003ca href=\"tel:+912066863333\"\u003e\n                                +91 2066863333\n                            \u003c/a\u003e\n                            \u003cbr /\u003e\n\n                            \u003cstrong\u003eWebsite:\u003c/strong\u003e\n                            \u003ca href=\"https://www.nyatigroup.com\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\n                                www.nyatigroup.com\n                            \u003c/a\u003e\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n                    "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"58:T470,\n                        \u003ch2\u003eCancellation and Refund Policy\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            In case the Allottee / Purchaser/s cancels the booking of the Unit\n                            / Apartment and or in the event of cancellation/termination of the\n                            Agreement in respect of the Unit agreed to be purchased by the\n                            Allottee, the Promoter shall forfeit the amount paid by the\n                            Allottee /s in terms of the Allotment Letter and or the Agreement\n                            (as the case may be) and the balance amount due and payable if any,\n                            shall be refunded to the Allottee/ Purchaser in terms thereof.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eDispute Resolution\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Any disputes between the parties shall be settled amicably. In case\n                            of failure to settle such dispute amicably, the same shall be\n                            referred to RERA.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n                    59:T1197,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Thanks for visiting our website. Nyati Builders Pvt. Ltd.\n                            appreciates your interest in our organisation and the\n                            facilities we offer. Your privacy is important to us and we\n                            want you to feel comfortable in visiting our site. Any\n                            personal information that you may give us, including your\n                            e-mail address, is used only for data storing for our\n                            personal records.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            In visiting our site, if you give us personal data in order\n                            to receive any type of information in return from us, we\n                            collect and store that data. That information is helpful to\n                            better design our site because we know the frequency of\n                            visits to the individual pages within our site.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            In visiting our site, if you view specific pages or download\n                            information from specific pages, we track visits to those\n                            pages in order to measure the number of visitors to our\n                            website. That information is helpful to better design our\n                            site because we know which pages within our site are\n                            frequented. However, we do not automatically collect your\n                            personal e-mail address simply because you visit our site.\n                            All we know, based on the information that we collect, is\n                            the number of times on a date that a particular page was\n                            visited.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            We may share aggregate demographic information with our\n                            partners. This is not linked to any personal information\n                            that can identify you or any other visitor to our website.\n                            If we partner in the future with a third party to provide\n                            services, when you sign up for these services we will share\n                            names and other contact information that is necessary for\n                            our partner to provide these services. These parties are not\n                            allowed to use your personally identifiable information\n                            except for the purpose of providing these services.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            When you visit\n                            \u003ca\n                                href=\"https://www.nyatigroup.com\"\n                                target=\"_blank\"\n                                rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n                            \u003e\n                                www.nyatigroup.com\n                            \u003c/a\u003e\n                            or voluntarily send e-mails to us, you are communicating\n                            with us electronically. We will keep a record of this\n                            information so that we can respond to you periodically. We\n                            only collect information from you when you register on our\n                            website or fill out a form. Also, when filling out a form on\n                            our website, you may be asked to enter your: Name, E-mail\n                            address or Phone / Mobile Number. You may, however, visit\n                            our website anonymously. By communicating with us and\n                            submitting your personal information and contact details,\n                            you consent to receive communication from us through Email,\n                            SMS, Call, WhatsApp or any other communication medium, even\n                            if your number has DND activated on it. You agree that all\n                            agreements, notices, disclosures, and other communications\n                            that we provide to you electronically satisfy any legal\n                            requirement that such communication be in writing.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n                    "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5a:T40c,\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            The information on this site is provided “as is” without any\n                            warranties, express or implied, including but not limited to\n                            the implied warranties for a particular purpose, or\n                            non-infringement.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Nyati Builders Pvt. Ltd. makes no representation or warranty\n                            that the information contained on this site will be timely\n                            or error-free. Nyati Builders Pvt. Ltd. have not reviewed\n                            all the sites that may be linked to its sites and does not\n                            endorse and is not responsible for the content of any\n                            off-site pages or any other sites linked to these sites.\n                            Your linking to such sites is at your own risk.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n                    5b:T2135,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\n                        \u003ch2\u003eIntroduction\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            At Nyati Group, your privacy is of utmost importance to us.\n                            We are committed to ensuring that your personal information\n                            remains confidential, secure, and is used only in ways that\n                            are consistent with your expectations. This policy outlines\n                            how we collect, use, store, and protect the information you\n                            share with us via our website:\n                            \u003ca\n                                href=\"https://www.nyatigroup.com\"\n                                target=\"_blank\"\n                                rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n                            \u003e\n                                www.nyatigroup.com\n                            \u003c/a\u003e\n                            .\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eInformation We Collect\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            To provide you with detailed information about our\n                            residential and commercial projects, we may ask you to share\n                            your name, contact number, email address, and other basic\n                            information. This allows us to offer you timely updates,\n                            personalized support, and project-specific details.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            From time to time, we may request additional information to\n                            better understand your preferences and serve you more\n                            efficiently. We may also collect usage data through tools\n                            such as cookies and session variables, which help us enhance\n                            the browsing experience and analyze site traffic. These\n                            cookies do not capture personal information unless you\n                            voluntarily provide it.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Additionally, we may retain records of your communication\n                            with us - including emails, queries, survey responses, and\n                            feedback - to ensure continuous improvement in our customer\n                            service.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eUse of Collected Information\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            The information collected is used solely to improve your\n                            experience with Nyati Group, including:\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cul\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eResponding to enquiries and service requests\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eSending updates, newsletters, or promotional content\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eProviding project-related information and offers\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eEnhancing website functionality and user experience\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003c/ul\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            We do not sell or rent any personal information to third\n                            parties. However, we may share aggregated,\n                            non-personally identifiable insights with our marketing\n                            partners or affiliates to understand customer behaviour and\n                            preferences.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Your personal data will only be shared in the following\n                            circumstances:\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cul\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003eWith your explicit consent\u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\n                                When legally required to comply with government or\n                                judicial orders\n                            \u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\n                                To facilitate a service or transaction you have\n                                requested\n                            \u003c/li\u003e\n                            \u003cli\u003e\n                                During corporate restructuring or sale of the company,\n                                where successor entities may gain access under strict\n                                confidentiality\n                            \u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003c/ul\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eData Storage and Security\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Nyati Group employs industry-standard security measures to\n                            safeguard your information against unauthorized access, loss,\n                            or misuse. Although we strive to keep our systems secure, no\n                            platform is completely immune to cyber threats. We will not\n                            be liable for any loss of data due to events beyond our\n                            reasonable control, such as cyberattacks or technical\n                            failures.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Data is stored only as long as it is necessary to fulfil its\n                            intended purpose, after which it may be securely deleted or\n                            anonymized.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eCommunication Preferences\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            You have full control over how you’d like to hear from us.\n                            You may opt out of receiving marketing communications,\n                            newsletters, or promotional content at any time by clicking\n                            the unsubscribe link in our emails or by updating your\n                            preferences on our website.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003eDisclaimer and Limitation of Liability\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Nyati Group makes every effort to ensure the accuracy of\n                            information shared on our website. However, we do not\n                            guarantee that all content is free from errors or omissions.\n                            All project-related visuals, specifications, and timelines\n                            are subject to change without prior notice, and do not\n                            constitute a legal offering.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            We are not responsible for any direct or indirect loss that\n                            may arise from the reliance on the information provided on\n                            our website.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003ch2\u003ePolicy Updates\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            Nyati Group reserves the right to update or revise this\n                            privacy policy from time to time to reflect changes in our\n                            practices or legal requirements. Any modifications will be\n                            posted on this page with an updated effective date.\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            For any concerns or queries regarding your privacy, please\n                            contact us at:\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            \u003cstrong\u003eEmail:\u003c/strong\u003e\n                            \u003ca href=\"mailto:info@nyatigroup.com\"\u003e\n                                info@nyatigroup.com\n                            \u003c/a\u003e\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            \u003cstrong\u003ePhone:\u003c/strong\u003e\n                            \u003ca href=\"tel:+912066863333\"\u003e\n                                +91 2066863333\n                            \u003c/a\u003e\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            \u003cstrong\u003eWebsite:\u003c/strong\u003e\n                            \u003ca\n                                href=\"https://www.nyatigroup.com\"\n                                target=\"_blank\"\n                                rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n                            \u003e\n                                www.nyatigroup.com\n                            \u003c/a\u003e\n                        \u003c/p\u003e\n                    "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5c:T44c,\n                        \u003cp\u003e\n                            In case the Allottee / Purchaser/s cancels the booking of\n                    